Changes from the original: the queue is Odoo Project tasks instead of GitHub issues; a triage
step splits each task into back-end sub-tasks (built by the factory) and front-end sub-tasks
(for people, with the API contract); sub-tasks merge into a parent branch, which merges into
the integration branch after a whole-branch approval; the factory's state machine, gate and
Odoo client are a Python package (`sf`); stack profiles (Java/Maven, Odoo) provide the gate
and the reviewers; agent prompts are in Italian.

